### 测试 RabbitMQ

### ==================== 练习 1：Direct 模式 ====================

### 1. 发送订单消息（Direct）
POST http://localhost:8080/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD20240101001",
  "productName": "Java编程思想",
  "amount": 108.00
}

### 2. 再发一条订单消息
POST http://localhost:8080/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD20240101002",
  "productName": "Spring Boot实战",
  "amount": 79.00
}

### ==================== 练习 2：Fanout 广播 ====================

### 3. 发送广播通知（短信队列和邮件队列都会收到）
POST http://localhost:8080/order/notify?message=您的订单已发货

### 4. 再发一条广播
POST http://localhost:8080/order/notify?message=系统将于今晚22点维护
